xperts had also been critical of the American and Canadian pairs in the press, claiming that many of their lifts violated the rules. Despite this, the 1956 Olympic figure skating was a highwater mark for North American figure skating, as US skaters won the men’s and ladies’ events, and overall, the US and Canada won six of the nine medals awarded."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/12968"} "Singles, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "29 January –  1 February 1956"] "\n" [:td {} "16"] "\n" [:td {} "11"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/12998"} "Singles, Women"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "30 January –  2 February 1956"] "\n" [:td {} "21"] "\n" [:td {} "11"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/13034"} "Pairs, Mixed"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} " 3 February 1956"] "\n" [:td {} "22"] "\n" [:td {} "7"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n59 (27/32)\n"] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n15 (12/12)\n"] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n\n\n" [:h2 {} "Medals"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {:class "top"} [:a {:href "/results/12968"} "Singles, Men"]] "\n" [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} [:a {:href "/athletes/87518"} "Hayes Jenkins"]] [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png